Written comparison of Future vs Queueable vs Batch.
8. Future vs Queueable vs Batch Apex
Feature	Future	Queueable	Batch
Execution	Asynchronous	Asynchronous	Asynchronous
Suitable for	Simple background operations	More complex async jobs	Large data volumes
Parameters	Primitive types / collections	Can use class variables / objects	Processes records in batches
Job monitoring	Apex Jobs	Apex Jobs	Apex Jobs
Best use	Simple async update	Complex background processing	Thousands/millions of records
Interview Answer

Future Apex: Used to execute simple operations asynchronously.

Queueable Apex: Used for more complex asynchronous processing and provides better control than Future.

Batch Apex: Used when processing very large numbers of records in manageable batches.

